      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The cross-modality matching methods of Stevens [16] have been used by Gracely and his colleagues [4-6] to provide numerical values for \"verbal pain descriptors.\" These numerical values, it is claimed, provide reliable, objective and valid ratio-level measurement of the sensory and affective dimensions of pain. Each of these claims is critically examined."},
